    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Cathal Meares of Sheehy Meares Real Estate is delighted to present 18 Deerpark, Ballinasloe, Co. Galway, H53 PY61, to the market.\n\nConstructed in 1899 and extending to approximately 62.7 sq. m (675 sq. ft), this attractive two-storey terraced residence is located within a mature and well established residential area of Ballinasloe town. Presented in walk in condition, the property offers comfortable and well-proportioned accommodation throughout.\n\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming living room featuring a solid fuel stove, a spacious kitchen and dining area with a second solid fuel stove, a bedroom and a main bathroom with shower facilities. Upstairs, the accommodation is completed by two further bedrooms.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a large rear garden with useful storage sheds, providing excellent outdoor space and further potential for the new owners.\n\nThe residence has oil fired central heating and holds a D1 BER rating. Its convenient location provides easy access to Ballinasloe town centre and the wide range of shops, schools, recreational facilities and transport links available locally.\n\nThis walk in home is ideally suited to first-time buyers, families or investors seeking a well located property in Ballinasloe.\n\nContact estate agent Cathal Meares today to arrange a viewing."
      },
